Kind: widen
Issue: #599
Holds open: consolewrite()'s printf_lock hold, for an interrupt -- once, after tick 3000, processor 0 raises inside it an ISA line whose handler is intnull(), so intnull()'s printf runs nested in the holder; the fixed tree prints the line and goes on
Run: i386, UROS_NCPUS > 1 -- scripts/run-qemu.sh --fresh-disk --smp 4 -display none -serial mon:stdio

